cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and cite
  the Gridworld-10 dataset separately according to its owner's instructions.
title: Gridworld-10 Offline Reinforcement Learning
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Do
    given-names: Chi Khoa
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dochikhoa2006/GridWorld-Deep-Reinforcement-Learning"
url: "https://github.com/Dochikhoa2006/GridWorld-Deep-Reinforcement-Learning"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible PyTorch pipeline for comparing DQN, Double DQN, Expected
  SARSA, and discrete Conservative Q-Learning on a fixed 10 by 10 Gridworld
  transition dataset.
keywords:
  - offline reinforcement learning
  - conservative Q-learning
  - DQN
  - Double DQN
  - Expected SARSA
  - Gridworld
